              [In the case of FDDI (e.g., ‘ffddddii pprroottoo aarrpp’), Token Ring (e.g.,
              ‘ttrr pprroottoo aarrpp’), and IEEE  802.11  wireless  LANS  (e.g.,  ‘wwllaann
